{"title":"Sandslate","slug":"Sandslate","pageid":3077,"revid":15802,"timestamp":"2024-11-16T02:37:34Z","lastEditor":"Eaglefun2","categories":["Stubs","Stone"],"infobox":{"type":"Ore","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater Island"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.60.0"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$13/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$18/stud"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"ores","text":"Ores"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Sandslate?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Sandslate</b> is a type of node that spawns on the mountains and in the caverns of the Oke Desert within <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>. \n</p><p>Raw Sandslate looks identical to the ground that is usually found at the top of the mountains that spawn the nodes themselves, being cracked with a tan-ish coloring, making them blend in better.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"ores\">Ores</h2>\n<p>The following ores can spawn in Sandslate nodes:\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BetterNewInkStone\">BetterNewInkStone</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Inkstone/\">Inkstone</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pyrite\">Pyrite</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pyrite/\">Pyrite</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lithium\">Lithium</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lithium/\">Lithium</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rose gold\">Rose gold</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rose_Gold/\">Rose Gold</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Palladiumraw\">Palladiumraw</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Palladium/\">Palladium</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Uraniumraw\">Uraniumraw</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uranium/\">Uranium</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Silver Ore\">Silver Ore</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Silver/\">Silver</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Jade Ore\">Jade Ore</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Jade/\">Jade</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
